{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"平\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：Y 的加亮词从试探靠近、渐渐欢喜、担心失去到接受无法保证，单扫重点也能串起完整主线；X 只有 S01、S04、S07 出现大块，其他屏的情绪推进缺少大字承接，且感受意象较多，容易冲淡核心。small、human：Y 的小字大多贴着当屏的关系变化补充身体感和具体体验，叙述也更接近日常口语；X 的「暂时不去哪里」「对生的眷恋」「亲密的谈话触碰到某些无法解开的结」有明显的抽象、书面表达，部分意象衔接也较松。concise：两边都有回环，X 有近义感受意象反复出现，Y 则多次回到不隐藏喜欢和无法保证未来，差距不明显；fine：X 的失重、湿热的风、漂浮、喉咙发紧等体验更有身体感和辨识度，Y 相对常用「高兴」「孤单」「没底」等概括性词语，部分小字也在描述音乐而非观众体验；load：X 是较少但较长的大块，Y 是较多但较短的加亮词，结合各屏停留时间，两边的扫读负担大致相当。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2e5e2185-6e9b-4033-8c25-aeee2977f625", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T194806353683Z", "elapsed_seconds": 338.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:53:44.609730+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "97fa79af4312f2517b77e77a974561bf691dd609d57684de52b315f60bfc859a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d